; The windtrap reporting binary — the third and last home of coverage
; code (RFC Law 12). One subcommand, `coverage`: find and merge the
; .coverage files under _build/_coverage, render the per-file table and
; excerpts, gate with --min, export --json. The table and excerpt layout
; live in the library renderer (reached through Windtrap.Private), so the
; in-process WINDTRAP_COVERAGE modes and this command cannot drift.

(executable
 (name main)
 (public_name windtrap)
 (package windtrap)
 (libraries windtrap windtrap_coverage))
